94; airway volume total, changes in airway volume for the total model; &#x00394; airway volume central, changes in airway volume for the central airway model; &#x00394; airway volume distal, changes in airway resistance for the distal airway model; P1-P5, patients 1 to 5 mean values for each parameter; SD, standard deviation.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>